  message: "PARTIAL 2026-09-29 (PR 1306, merged). (a) STILL NEEDED: warn_unused_ignores=true under strict, and the whole-tree run reports no unused-ignore, so every remaining suppression still suppresses something. (b) CODES: the last two bare ignores (sketch.py selected_key_symbols' deliberate None default -> [assignment]; lua.py fa.tree -> [arg-type]) now carry codes; ignore-without-code is 0. (c) NOT DONE: the per-site bug-or-justified review of the 37 coded ignores -- 17 union-attr (candidate None dereferences, WI-vokiz's class), 8 attr-defined, 5 assignment, 3 no-any-return, 2 valid-type, 2 arg-type, across cfg.py, verify_claims.py, sketch.py, analyzer_identity.py, cli.py, cyclomatic.py, taint.py, openapi.py, astro.py, py.py, lua.py, merge_producers.py, rust_analyzer invoke.py, tracker race_log.py / serve.py. Item stays open for (c)."  # 3bf7
